  "scope": "Pure preview/source readiness/annual readiness v2 only. No workflow, SQL, runtime admission, approval, Archive, HTTP or writer activation.",
  "implementation": [
    "Pure preview preparation explicitly validates v2 source integrity and command scope, retaining the existing renderer, rendering profile and preview codec. Historical stored preview reads still never rerender.",
    "New immutable source-readiness-v2 evidence and proof retain original Governance enumeration, full chain enumeration and combined projection commitments. Existing v1 types/functions remain unchanged.",
    "New annual-readiness-v2 proof reuses the existing annual policy through one private assessment function; validation ordering, issues, accepted/required warnings and exclusions remain unchanged.",
    "A separate elevenrecord v2 annual codec rejects duplicate keys, unknown records, cross-version substitutions and noncanonical bytes. Fixed declared nested types are checked separately from value-only hashes; malformed RF ID constructor errors normalize to basis_unavailable.",
    "Module exports, stdlib imports and two automatically discovered unit tests are registered. Existing fresh admission, preview persistence, source approval, claims, dispatch, Archive and SQL remain closed to v2."
  ],
